# BATCH 2 — Python Engine Core (Materialized)

> Drop every file below into the repo at the path shown. `tools/freeze_gold.py` becomes runnable at the end of this batch, which is the gate for Batch 3. Two corrections to earlier batches are included (§ 0.1, § 0.2) and must be applied before running.
>
> **Say "next"** for Batch 3 (Python Reliability Layer).

---

## § 0. Pre-flight corrections

### 0.1 `pyproject.toml` — package root fix

Batch 0 shipped `packages = ["engine.python.oarumi", ...]`, which makes the import path `engine.python.oarumi`, not `oarumi`. Replace the `[tool.setuptools]` block:

```toml
[tool.setuptools]
package-dir = { "" = "engine/python" }
packages = ["oarumi", "tools", "desktop"]

[tool.setuptools.packages.find]
where = ["engine/python", "."]
include = ["oarumi*", "tools*", "desktop*"]
```

Then re-run `pip install -e ".[dev]"`.

### 0.2 `.gitignore` — parity cache

Add:

```gitignore
tests/parity/.cache/
```

